apiweaver_sandbox/

# Documentation and non-essential repository files
Project-docs/
monitoring/
infra/terraform/
**/README.md
**/README.txt
**/*.md
LICENSE
SECURITY.md
CONTRIBUTING.md

# Frontend (not needed for backend/agent-worker builds; both casing handled)
frontend/
Frontend/
frontend-*/
Frontend-*/

# Scripts (only backend code needed in agent-worker/backend images)
scripts/

# Database migrations (alembic) - not needed for agent-worker
backend/alembic/

